/*
/* Program ........ REH-REAX
/*
/* Function ....... Lists and/or deletes all NOM archives including the
/*                  reports from a NOM environment
/*
/* Plattform ...... Linux, Unix
/*
/***********************************************************************
/*
/* Program Description:
/* ------------------------------
/* This program is for test purposes only.
/*
/***********************************************************************
DEFINE DATA LOCAL
